{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Liv: Nordic Survival",
    "steam_appid": 3642500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your awakening is the end of everything you thought you knew \u2013 and the beginning of something greater than yourself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/e3fa84f47dc25fddf7397e807d72f5ea.avif?t=1748423838\" data-has-big width=800 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes. Cold. Wind. Earth. Beneath you: blue cracks stretch across the ground, from which light and energy pulse \u2013 as if the world has exposed its innermost secrets. You remember nothing. No name. No origin. No why. Only one thing is clear: You are alone. Naked. And this place... lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger sets in. Thirst scratches at your throat. But is the water drinkable? Nature demands respect \u2013 or your life. Adapt to survive in harmony with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival is not an option \u2013 it is your only way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/05305466072421f21cffd67f1837a0ee.avif?t=1748423838\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings and gather what might prove useful. First tools take shape. A spear. An axe. Perhaps enough for a primitive trap. Hunting means food. Food means time. Time to learn. Time to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/8dee2d947c8c88999b0645078b738429.avif?t=1748423838\" data-has-big width=800 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build your first shelter. Protection \u2013 though rudimentary... And as you progress, the island changes. The days grow shorter. The nights grow colder. Snowflakes signal what\u2019s to come: Winter is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And you will have to be prepared.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/17f445bc24f50196491245759f9b87e0.avif?t=1748423838\" data-has-big width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build. Hunt. Gather supplies. Explore the secrets of the blue cracks, which may hold the key to your past \u2013 or any answer at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not just a game of survival. It is a game of truth. Of memory. And of hope in a world that has long forgotten you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an open-world survival game playable in both first- and third-person perspectives.<br>The current version includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large explorable map divided into <strong>4 distinct regions</strong>, each with unique environments and resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core survival mechanics such as <strong>hunting, fishing, crafting, and resource management</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>base building system</strong> that allows players to construct and customize shelters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>skill progression and leveling system</strong> to improve abilities like stamina, crafting efficiency, or strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A working inventory system with storage management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day/night cycle and weather effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and co-op gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...with more content and polish planned during Early Access development</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your awakening is the end of everything you thought you knew \u2013 and the beginning of something greater than yourself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/e3fa84f47dc25fddf7397e807d72f5ea.avif?t=1748423838\" data-has-big width=800 height=298 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes. Cold. Wind. Earth. Beneath you: blue cracks stretch across the ground, from which light and energy pulse \u2013 as if the world has exposed its innermost secrets. You remember nothing. No name. No origin. No why. Only one thing is clear: You are alone. Naked. And this place... lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger sets in. Thirst scratches at your throat. But is the water drinkable? Nature demands respect \u2013 or your life. Adapt to survive in harmony with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival is not an option \u2013 it is your only way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/05305466072421f21cffd67f1837a0ee.avif?t=1748423838\" data-has-big width=800 height=334 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings and gather what might prove useful. First tools take shape. A spear. An axe. Perhaps enough for a primitive trap. Hunting means food. Food means time. Time to learn. Time to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/8dee2d947c8c88999b0645078b738429.avif?t=1748423838\" data-has-big width=800 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build your first shelter. Protection \u2013 though rudimentary... And as you progress, the island changes. The days grow shorter. The nights grow colder. Snowflakes signal what\u2019s to come: Winter is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And you will have to be prepared.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642500/extras/17f445bc24f50196491245759f9b87e0.avif?t=1748423838\" data-has-big width=800 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build. Hunt. Gather supplies. Explore the secrets of the blue cracks, which may hold the key to your past \u2013 or any answer at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is not just a game of survival. It is a game of truth. Of memory. And of hope in a world that has long forgotten you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an open-world survival game playable in both first- and third-person perspectives.<br>The current version includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large explorable map divided into <strong>4 distinct regions</strong>, each with unique environments and resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core survival mechanics such as <strong>hunting, fishing, crafting, and resource management</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>base building system</strong> that allows players to construct and customize shelters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>skill progression and leveling system</strong> to improve abilities like stamina, crafting efficiency, or strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A working inventory system with storage management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic day/night cycle and weather effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-player and co-op gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...with more content and polish planned during Early Access development</p>",
    "short_description": "You are LIV. Naked and with no memory, you awaken on a mysterious island. Discover who you are. Hunt, build, craft \u2013 survive cold, hunger, and madness. Learn, evolve, and uncover the secret that seems to slumber beneath the surface.",
